tering through surrounding foliage, combined with cozy tungsten light spilling from the cottage windows to create a welcoming atmosphere.\",\n  \"mood\": \"cozy, heartwarming, detailed, whimsical, peaceful, domestic\",\n  \"background\": \"Heavily blurred forest undergrowth with soft creamy bokeh, emphasizing the scale of the miniature world.\",\n  \"composition\": \"Eye-level macro shot, slightly high angle to show the porch and house structure, shallow depth of field making the subject look like a toy model, rule of thirds.\",\n  \"camera\": {\n    \"angle\": \"Eye-level macro\",\n    \"distance\": \"Close-up\",\n    \"focus\": \"Sharp focus on the rabbit family and mushroom house details\",\n    \"lens\": \"Sony FE 90mm f/2.8 Macro G OSS\",\n    \"camera_model\": \"Sony Alpha a7R IV\",\n    \"f-number\": 4.5,\n    \"ISO\": 200,\n    \"shutter_speed\": \"1/125\"\n  },\n  \"effects\": [\n    \"tilt-shift blur\",\n    \"soft bloom\",\n    \"high texture detail\",\n    \"subsurface scattering on mushroom\",\n    \"volumetric light rays\",\n    \"warm color grading\"\n  ]\n}"], "inputs": [{"name": "clip", "link": 117, "label": "clip", "type": "CLIP", "localized_name": "clip"}, {"widget": {"name": "text"}, "name": "text", "link": 208, "label": "text", "type": "STRING", "localized_name": "text"}], "flags": {}, "type": "CLIPTextEncode", "title": "CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)", "mode": 0, "bgcolor": "#353", "size": [430, 200], "pos": [-630, -52.0733642578125], "id": 6, "properties": {"cnr_id": "comfy-core", "hasSecondTab": false, "ver": "0.3.71", "widget_ue_connectable": {"text": true}, "secondTabText": "Send Back", "enableTabs": false, "secondTabOffset": 80, "Node name for S&R": "CLIPTextEncode", "tabWidth": 65, "secondTabWidth": 65, "tabXOffset": 10}, "order": 13}, {"outputs": [{"name": "CONDITIONING", "slot_index": 0, "links": [165], "label": "CONDITIONING", "type": "CONDITIONING", "localized_name": "CONDITIONING"}], "color": "#233", "widgets_values": [4], "input